# Local development environment.
#
# NOT COMMITTED and never should be: .gitignore covers it. Vercel holds the
# real values for production and preview, and NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined at
# BUILD time, so a key set only in Vercel works there and never locally.
#
# The MapTiler key is NOT missing from the platform: the founder verified it
# is set in Vercel for production and preview on 23 September. This file is
# only how a sandbox gets one locally. Without it the map renders the
# non-commercial OpenStreetMap CARTO fallback, which is a local-only
# appearance and not a product defect.

NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_KEY=
